WEBVTT

00:00:02.336 --> 00:00:08.969
Dying a child

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:10.787
Dying a child

00:00:10.811 --> 00:00:15.292
Oh, Kiss me deadly

00:00:15.316 --> 00:00:19.663
<i>Kiss me, kill me, love me</i>

00:00:19.687 --> 00:00:24.100
Oh, Kiss me deadly

00:00:24.124 --> 00:00:28.618
<i>Kiss me, kill me, love me</i>

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:34.744
Dying a child

00:00:34.768 --> 00:00:41.674
Oh, Child prey

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:50.209
Oh, Child prey

00:00:52.353 --> 00:01:00.353
Hurry and May

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:03.239
The reasons why one can't
laugh from the heart

00:01:03.263 --> 00:01:05.408
It's a simple reason... that's life

00:01:05.432 --> 00:01:09.946
Oh, Kiss me deadly

00:01:09.970 --> 00:01:14.184
<i>Kiss me, kill me, love me</i>

00:01:14.208 --> 00:01:18.788
Oh, Kiss me deadly

00:01:18.812 --> 00:01:22.926
<i>Kiss me, kill me, love me</i>

00:01:22.950 --> 00:01:27.464
Oh, Kiss me deadly

00:01:27.488 --> 00:01:33.336
<i>Kiss me, kill me, love me</i>

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:38.274
Child is burning

00:01:38.298 --> 00:01:42.257
Oh, Kiss me deadly

00:01:51.645 --> 00:01:54.124
All right... Maybe I overpacked.

00:01:54.148 --> 00:01:56.776
No way... It'll be good for me.

00:02:25.345 --> 00:02:27.575
Great.

00:02:47.868 --> 00:02:51.168
Man, why does he live
all the way out here?

00:02:56.543 --> 00:02:58.204
I made it.

00:03:03.183 --> 00:03:08.064
I haven't seen a human in a year and
a half... Perhaps I should eat you.

00:03:08.088 --> 00:03:14.084
Hey, Ando! It's so good to see you again!
Don't you recognize me? It's me, Baki.

00:03:15.329 --> 00:03:21.325
Baki? You snot-nosed little runt!
I can't believe how much you've grown.

00:03:22.136 --> 00:03:23.580
What's Yujiro up to?

00:03:23.604 --> 00:03:26.950
Oh, this and that. Same as always.

00:03:26.974 --> 00:03:31.688
That's good... Tonight...
I'll treat you to some bear sashimi...

00:03:31.712 --> 00:03:34.340
It's different, but really tasty.

00:03:40.487 --> 00:03:43.013
Poor kid must be exhausted.

00:04:07.181 --> 00:04:08.478
Awesome.

00:04:18.825 --> 00:04:21.556
Oh, man. That's huge!

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:32.034
Well, look who decided to wake up.

00:04:33.140 --> 00:04:34.484
Feel better now?

00:04:34.508 --> 00:04:37.620
Yeah... This tree is amazing.

00:04:37.644 --> 00:04:39.889
Yes, that it is.

00:04:39.913 --> 00:04:44.360
It's pretty old, too.
At least a thousand years.

00:04:44.384 --> 00:04:45.962
Really?

00:04:45.986 --> 00:04:49.566
They normally die after a
hundred or so, but not this one.

00:04:49.590 --> 00:04:51.201
It's still going strong.

00:04:51.225 --> 00:04:54.871
You know, this tree has seen twenty
or thirty generations of humans

00:04:54.895 --> 00:04:58.575
pass through this forest...
It's wiser than any man.

00:04:58.599 --> 00:05:01.844
Baki... What is it that made
you come up here to see me?

00:05:01.868 --> 00:05:04.428
I doubt you're here just to visit.

00:05:46.980 --> 00:05:48.277
Eat up.

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:52.729
You killed this bear all by yourself?

00:05:52.753 --> 00:05:57.400
Well I may not be strong enough to
kill polar bears like Yujiro used to,

00:05:57.424 --> 00:06:01.871
but these fists of mine are plenty
strong for the bears around these parts.

00:06:01.895 --> 00:06:04.694
It seems like you've gotten bigger
since the last time I saw you.

00:06:06.233 --> 00:06:08.361
Well, I've had a lot of time to bulk up.

00:06:16.476 --> 00:06:18.187
Wow! This is good!

00:06:18.211 --> 00:06:20.145
I told you so.

00:06:24.351 --> 00:06:26.012
Darn wasabi!

00:06:36.196 --> 00:06:38.941
So you lost to a regular old boxer?

00:06:38.965 --> 00:06:41.900
Yeah, but he is the world champion.

00:06:43.537 --> 00:06:45.232
What a wimp.

00:06:47.307 --> 00:06:49.935
Let's step outside, Baki.

00:06:53.246 --> 00:06:58.582
When Yujiro came here, he would do this
exercise every day... We would compete.

00:07:00.454 --> 00:07:01.785
Watch this.

00:07:16.837 --> 00:07:21.832
Almost all fights are won
by those who can eat the most.

00:07:23.944 --> 00:07:27.423
Just give me one month...
That's all I need...

00:07:27.447 --> 00:07:32.510
And I'll fill your body with the same power
I have so you can beat Yuri with ease.

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:35.665
Thank you...

00:07:35.689 --> 00:07:39.202
There is one thing I'd
like to ask of you.

00:07:39.226 --> 00:07:40.921
What's that, Baki?

00:07:44.531 --> 00:07:46.761
Yuri! Big smile now!

00:07:48.135 --> 00:07:50.832
Quevas! Yuri! Do a quick pose!

00:07:56.109 --> 00:07:58.321
Madam... About Baki.

00:07:58.345 --> 00:07:59.938
What about him?

00:08:03.984 --> 00:08:05.962
What do you recommend?

00:08:05.986 --> 00:08:07.263
Just leave him be.

00:08:07.287 --> 00:08:08.584
Yes.

00:08:09.189 --> 00:08:13.002
He's just starting out on the
same path that his father did.

00:08:13.026 --> 00:08:14.585
As you wish.

00:08:28.675 --> 00:08:31.320
You want to what?!

00:08:31.344 --> 00:08:35.212
I want to camp on Yasha Crag. Alone.

00:08:35.348 --> 00:08:37.427
By yourself? Alone?

00:08:37.451 --> 00:08:41.697
Baki, do you realize how
dangerous that place can be?

00:08:41.721 --> 00:08:43.800
Ando, I know.

00:08:43.824 --> 00:08:48.504
It would be like sending a child out on the
streets of New York to fend for himself...

00:08:48.528 --> 00:08:51.174
Don't underestimate the mountains.

00:08:51.198 --> 00:08:53.543
Believe me, I'm not...

00:08:53.567 --> 00:08:57.834
Just thinking about staying on Yasha
Crag is making my hands tremble.

00:09:04.744 --> 00:09:07.475
I have to go through with it.

00:09:08.715 --> 00:09:10.960
I'm certain of it.

00:09:10.984 --> 00:09:16.065
Do you have any idea what lives up there?
Something you can't imagine.

00:09:16.089 --> 00:09:19.669
Yasha Crag is not a place for kids.
Survival is impossible.

00:09:19.693 --> 00:09:23.061
I'm going to train there,
whether you like it or not!

00:09:24.965 --> 00:09:27.844
I'm sorry... I shouldn't have said that.

00:09:27.868 --> 00:09:33.466
Your dad was the same way... What the
hell kind of family are you anyway?

00:09:49.022 --> 00:09:50.717
Whoa!

00:10:01.234 --> 00:10:04.780
Baki. I want you to take this axe.

00:10:04.804 --> 00:10:10.019
That's a monster up there...
Not just some ordinary ape.

00:10:10.043 --> 00:10:11.442
Monster?

00:10:12.946 --> 00:10:14.038
That's right.

00:10:14.915 --> 00:10:20.296
He's over nine feet tall, and is
around 150 years old. They call him...

00:10:20.320 --> 00:10:21.879
The Yasha Ape.

00:10:22.722 --> 00:10:26.802
He attacks with a mouthful of fangs
as numerous as a mountain range.

00:10:26.826 --> 00:10:28.070
Really?

00:10:28.094 --> 00:10:31.474
There used to be four Yasha Apes
in the surrounding mountains...

00:10:31.498 --> 00:10:33.743
Yujiro managed to kill one of them,

00:10:33.767 --> 00:10:36.579
though 1 assumed much of
that had to do with luck.

00:10:36.603 --> 00:10:40.082
Baki, you're not nearly as
strong as he was at the time.

00:10:40.106 --> 00:10:43.219
Look Ando... I know you mean well.

00:10:43.243 --> 00:10:44.720
But take this.

00:10:44.744 --> 00:10:46.255
You crazy?!

00:10:46.279 --> 00:10:50.512
That's precisely the type of beast
I want to fight with my bare hands!

00:10:51.251 --> 00:10:52.662
Baki...

00:10:52.686 --> 00:10:56.953
Who says I can't do something my
dad's already done before me?!

00:11:01.027 --> 00:11:04.588
Come on, Yasha Ape... Bring it on!

00:11:24.150 --> 00:11:25.777
It is a monster!

00:11:33.893 --> 00:11:35.571
Baki!

00:11:35.595 --> 00:11:37.393
Ando!

00:11:39.933 --> 00:11:44.013
Oh, great! I guess that didn't work.

00:11:44.037 --> 00:11:45.766
Ando! No!

00:12:20.273 --> 00:12:22.765
Ando! Watch out!

00:12:33.386 --> 00:12:34.979
Stop!

00:12:39.259 --> 00:12:43.506
Too strong... I'm no match for him.

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:46.397
Baki! Help!

00:12:57.711 --> 00:12:59.201
Damn you!

00:13:19.933 --> 00:13:21.924
No. You alright?

00:13:22.535 --> 00:13:26.631
Ando!

00:13:35.749 --> 00:13:39.462
Sorry about that, Ando.
But we have to disinfect it quickly.

00:13:39.486 --> 00:13:44.700
Baki... Get me the shotgun shells...
They're on the dresser there.

00:13:44.724 --> 00:13:46.522
Shotgun shells?

00:13:47.494 --> 00:13:48.825
Empty them out.

00:13:53.933 --> 00:13:56.011
Animal claws are the damnedest thing...

00:13:56.035 --> 00:13:59.215
Getting stuck with one is
like bathing in bacteria.

00:13:59.239 --> 00:14:02.766
Regular alcohol won't do me
much good on these wounds.

00:14:03.276 --> 00:14:04.653
Here you go.

00:14:04.677 --> 00:14:06.941
Ah, thank you, Baki.

00:14:09.182 --> 00:14:11.927
Will you hand me that towel over there?

00:14:11.951 --> 00:14:13.112
Here.

00:14:18.324 --> 00:14:19.883
You sure about this?

00:14:30.870 --> 00:14:35.569
Baki... Press that button over there.

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:38.209
Okay.

00:14:43.917 --> 00:14:47.997
We've received a distress signal from
Keichi Ando in mountain sector J.

00:14:48.021 --> 00:14:49.732
Immediate evacuation requested.

00:14:49.756 --> 00:14:54.091
This is Mountain Rescue. Show us
en route and we have a visual.

00:15:09.676 --> 00:15:12.388
1 never feared anything.

00:15:12.412 --> 00:15:17.760
I was proud of being feared by guys
who called themselves good fighters...

00:15:17.784 --> 00:15:20.129
Even when a top pro beat me,

00:15:20.153 --> 00:15:24.351
I still believed I could win by
rededicating myself to training.

00:15:26.726 --> 00:15:33.757
I thought I was afraid of nothing.
But now... the Yasha Ape terrifies me.

00:15:43.810 --> 00:15:47.289
It looks like he already disinfected
the wound by igniting gunpowder on it.

00:15:47.313 --> 00:15:49.941
He claims he was attacked
by a nine foot ape.

00:15:50.516 --> 00:15:54.163
Are you familiar with the children's
song that is sung in this region?

00:15:54.187 --> 00:15:59.735
"The strong shall go to Yasha Crag,
and do battle with the giant ape.”

00:15:59.759 --> 00:16:01.090
Yeah?

00:16:01.561 --> 00:16:06.041
I've heard that over the years, many
warriors have gone to fight the Yasha Ape

00:16:06.065 --> 00:16:10.366
to test their skills, and that not
one of them has ever returned.

00:16:16.109 --> 00:16:21.790
Excluding the more famous names, like
Musashi Miyamoto and Bokuden Tsukahara,

00:16:21.814 --> 00:16:25.561
the fates of nearly all ancient
warriors are unknown to this day.

00:16:25.585 --> 00:16:29.544
Some people say that's because
the Yasha Ape ate them.

00:16:32.492 --> 00:16:36.827
But, to be honest, I can't imagine
a monster like that existing today.

00:16:40.400 --> 00:16:43.267
Son of a--! This guy's huge!

00:16:47.273 --> 00:16:49.002
I will eat.

00:16:53.112 --> 00:16:57.276
I'I eat and eat and grow bigger!

00:17:02.722 --> 00:17:06.235
I will fill this
body the way Ando said...

00:17:06.259 --> 00:17:08.455
and grow stronger than ever before!

00:17:17.003 --> 00:17:19.472
I will settie the score!

00:17:20.473 --> 00:17:24.967
Who will it be? Who will reign
as the middleweight champion?

00:17:25.411 --> 00:17:30.893
Yuri pitted against Quevas!
It's the match-up of the century!

00:17:30.917 --> 00:17:32.612
And there's the bell.

00:17:35.355 --> 00:17:37.915
Hey boss... the match is starting.

00:17:38.958 --> 00:17:40.357
You gonna watch?

00:17:52.572 --> 00:17:57.052
Quevas unleashes a powerful storm of
punches, but Yuri is untouched and unfazed!

00:17:57.076 --> 00:17:59.773
Quevas hasn't landed a
jab this entire round!

00:18:00.380 --> 00:18:05.361
How lame... This fight was over
before it even started... So?

00:18:05.385 --> 00:18:10.632
I apologize... but I have not
been able to locate Baki yet.

00:18:10.656 --> 00:18:14.354
That's all right, Kuriyagama.
I know exactly what he's been up to.

00:18:15.528 --> 00:18:19.008
He is... attempting to cross the line.

00:18:19.032 --> 00:18:20.295
The line?

00:18:20.933 --> 00:18:23.679
The human brain sends a
distress signal to the body

00:18:23.703 --> 00:18:28.384
when one continues excessive exercise
over a long period of time...

00:18:28.408 --> 00:18:31.487
That signal manifests itself as pain...

00:18:31.511 --> 00:18:34.276
Your average human will
rest when that happens.

00:18:35.415 --> 00:18:38.394
But the human body can go
much further than that...

00:18:38.418 --> 00:18:41.230
If one ignores that signal
and continues to push on,

00:18:41.254 --> 00:18:43.599
the brain will finally stop the pain

00:18:43.623 --> 00:18:46.935
and produce a wonderful sensation
throughout the entire body.

00:18:46.959 --> 00:18:49.438
Wait. Do you mean...?

00:18:49.462 --> 00:18:54.176
Yes... the body does...
through the secretion of endorphins.

00:18:54.200 --> 00:18:55.711
Endorphins?

00:18:55.735 --> 00:19:00.649
You mean the chemicals that allow fighters
to continue until they die... Right?

00:19:00.673 --> 00:19:05.954
There's not a doubt in my mind. He's
trying to awaken his brain's endorphins.

00:19:05.978 --> 00:19:07.912
Isn't that right, Baki?

00:19:10.483 --> 00:19:12.952
Come on! Keep pushing!

00:19:16.756 --> 00:19:18.190
What's happening?

00:19:19.759 --> 00:19:21.386
What is this...?

00:19:34.073 --> 00:19:35.617
Is this it?

00:19:35.641 --> 00:19:42.775
Yes! Those are endorphins! Nearly all
top-class athletes experience this.

00:19:54.260 --> 00:19:57.491
<i>Incredible! This feeling
is unbelievable!</i>

00:20:03.269 --> 00:20:06.068
With this, I will be able to...

00:20:08.574 --> 00:20:11.976
Baki... It's much too
early to get excited.

00:20:20.786 --> 00:20:24.733
Grapplers have to take it
even further than that.

00:20:24.757 --> 00:20:29.138
Yuri ended it with a devastating counter
punch that sent Quevas to the mat.

00:20:29.162 --> 00:20:31.927
All that remains now
is the heavyweight bout.

00:20:32.999 --> 00:20:38.647
If you can't make yourself cross
that line, it's all over for you.

00:20:38.671 --> 00:20:41.834
And you'll never become a true Grappler.

00:20:42.542 --> 00:20:46.137
Get out here and show yourself!
We know you're in there!

00:20:50.550 --> 00:20:53.815
He's not home... but he left this note.

00:20:55.922 --> 00:20:58.254
"Going to the mountains to train. -Baki”

00:21:14.941 --> 00:21:16.136
it's time.

00:21:24.917 --> 00:21:27.113
I have to cross the line.

00:21:36.362 --> 00:21:41.027
I can't! I'll die if I try
to go through with this!

00:21:42.235 --> 00:21:44.829
Baki! Help!

00:21:46.772 --> 00:21:49.332
What the hell... I'll do it!

00:21:54.780 --> 00:21:57.806
I have to cross the line.

00:22:05.191 --> 00:22:07.250
Oh, crap!

00:22:45.031 --> 00:22:50.579
The hazy afternoon in the winter sun

00:22:50.603 --> 00:22:56.184
<i>hangs onto love in one
corner of the pavement</i>

00:22:56.208 --> 00:23:01.857
When I blew on my cold hands

00:23:01.881 --> 00:23:06.862
a tiny bit of courage swelled up.

00:23:06.886 --> 00:23:12.467
Today will certainly be wonderful,

00:23:12.491 --> 00:23:18.006
<i>gently enveloped in love</i>

00:23:18.030 --> 00:23:23.679
There are some strange feelings too,

00:23:23.703 --> 00:23:29.217
but they will be reborn

00:23:29.241 --> 00:23:34.890
Today will certainly be wonderful;

00:23:34.914 --> 00:23:40.853
they will be reborn as even more love.

00:23:54.867 --> 00:24:00.716
What did he see? What could
he grasp? The boy is reborn.

00:24:00.740 --> 00:24:04.519
When he fights it out with his
huge opponent, the Yasha Ape,

00:24:04.543 --> 00:24:08.357
further proof of his
mortality is carved into him.

00:24:08.381 --> 00:24:11.927
All for the sake of achieving
even greater strength.

00:24:11.951 --> 00:24:15.285
All for the sake of catching up to him.
